.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-HOOK 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-hook \- Run a harness hook such as session capture
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu hook\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a harness hook such as session capture
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-hook\-session\-capture(1)
Stop hook: solicit one knowledge episode per session from stdin JSON
.TP
quipu\-hook\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
